    "@id": "edam:topic_3314"
  },
  "sc:description": "A transparent, unit-aware calculator for the mathematical relationship between peptide mass, target concentration and solution volume. It normalizes mg, micrograms, mL and microlitres, shows the formula and includes a reference syringe visualization. Research-use-only software: it does not select a solvent, validate a laboratory method, calculate a dose or provide administration guidance.",
